# Current build status

usv is at v1.0.0, released 2026-08-30 and built in public against a phased plan. The authoritative, always-current state lives in the source repository: this page is a snapshot, not the source of truth, and may lag behind it.

## What is done

The full dual-render pipeline (gemtext to native Gemini and to classless HTML, one write-time pass, watched and re-rendered on every change), Titan uploads on the same listener, certificate-gated zones, an identity/roster CLI, an interactive terminal setup wizard, Tor/I2P-friendly defaults, and a full packaging matrix: Cloudron, .deb, RPM, AUR, Nix, a plain container image, and a static tarball: all built and verified, not just written.

## What is left before v1.0

Extended fuzz hardening, a clean run of the community gemini-diagnostics conformance suite against a live deployment, and the last of the pre-launch documentation. No announcement happens before that bar is cleared.

